                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7b30037-02b2-3220-9318-9a3279b5a0c7",
                        "entry_id": "5b4708d1-bbca-3914-8ddb-af4270a31384",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tabel waarin staat op welke tijden je moet werken of les hebt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81ca6078-2a24-47af-9d18-a676a5c80b65",
                                "sense_id": "f7b30037-02b2-3220-9318-9a3279b5a0c7",
                                "text": "Carrefour onderstreept te voordelen van de beslissing. ‘De zelfscankassa’s zullen zorgen voor meer variatie in de job, en een betere ergonomie. Daarnaast zal de polyactiviteit kunnen leiden tot een eenvoudigere inplanning van medewerkers, waardoor de uurroosters sneller ter beschikking zouden zijn.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33529a52-30db-4a8f-93a6-8a1abd27fe02",
                                "sense_id": "f7b30037-02b2-3220-9318-9a3279b5a0c7",
                                "text": "\"Een eerste conclusie is dat de jobkeuze het meest wordt beïnvloed door de goede werksfeer en de toffe collega's. Zowel de Generatie Z (18-22 jaar) als de Generatie Y (22-37 jaar) plaatsen die voorwaarde op de eerste plaats. Daarna volgen een hoog loon en een beperkte afstand naar het werk. De iets oudere generatie wil het liefst dichtbij huis werken.\"Andere troeven die jonge werknemers kunnen lokken zijn een glijdend uurrooster, de mogelijkheid om in het buitenland te gaan werken en het volgen van opleidingen. De optie om van thuis te werken en deeltijds aan de slag te kunnen, laat de jongeren evenmin onberoerd.de Standaard 21/12/2017 om 10:03 door (kme)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5be623cd-4777-4a79-ae20-16c0f60129d7",
                                "sense_id": "f7b30037-02b2-3220-9318-9a3279b5a0c7",
                                "text": "De pas afgestudeerde Master in de Computerwetenschappen noemt zijn toepassing Subway Positioning System. De technologie maakt gebruik van sensoren die standaard in een smartphone zitten en gekoppeld worden aan de uurroosters van de metrobedrijven. Zo kan worden berekend waar de gebruiker van het toestel zich exact bevindt en hoe lang het zal duren voordat hij in het volgende metrostation aankomt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "299f4583-e1e5-439f-bff3-9d4f0489eb7f",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b4708d1-bbca-3914-8ddb-af4270a31384",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7b30037-02b2-3220-9318-9a3279b5a0c7",
                        "source_sense_description": "tabel waarin staat op welke tijden je moet werken of les hebt",
                        "target_lang_word": "roster",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roster",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6f384-fc08-3f08-bb14-1b4a5a9a2453",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A list of individuals or groups, usually for an organization of some kind such as military officers and enlisted personnel enrolled in a particular unit; a muster roll; a sports team, with the names of players who are eligible to be placed in the lineup for a particular game; or a list of students officially enrolled in a school or class."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5891a212-f13e-4cc0-b79f-8ae71c6b784a",
                                                "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                                "text": "I'm number 12 on the roster for tonight's game."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3028c7ec-787c-490b-b3b6-e06a1ed0dcdf",
                                                "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                                "text": "Its 50 H-7 2-8-8-2's (30 of which found their way onto the Union Pacific roster in 1945) were simple mainly because a tunnel in the Alleghenies would not accommodate the low-pressure cylinders of any Mallet larger than a 2-6-6-2."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c15a4a-9635-4ec6-909f-90014de9fedd",
                                                "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                                "text": "As everyone knows, almost all booked passenger and freight trains are diagrammed into rosters for engines and men, and in an operating Utopia everything would work out daily according to plan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd57716-8836-41bb-885d-beaebd514de8",
                                                "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                                "text": "[So many of] the crew, men and officers alike, read them as to make me feel safe in asserting unreservedly that the Nathan James numbered in her company more Turgenev scholars than any other vessel on the United States Navy's entire roster of ships."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e234a694-67e7-4a62-a770-e56e26f405b3",
                                                "sense_id": "59fea9de-ecb5-378b-9ede-bed489f30aeb",
                                                "text": "The result was that trains ran as normal on November 7 and 9, although there was still disruption on Saturday November 5, owing to the short notice as rosters were hurriedly rewritten. Rosters are typically agreed a week in advance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e0da244-a98e-39e2-8463-7ff900665107",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6f384-fc08-3f08-bb14-1b4a5a9a2453",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A list of the jobs to be performed by members of an organization and often with the date and time that they are expected to perform them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a07113e-2d49-49d2-a6b2-23c6b2bb8184",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0da244-a98e-39e2-8463-7ff900665107",
                                                "text": "The secretary has produced a new cleaning roster for the Church over the remainder of the year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d31f9a27-d6df-3cf6-8205-6c94a4c4f2d9",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6f384-fc08-3f08-bb14-1b4a5a9a2453",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A schedule or timetable setting out shift times and dates for each employee of a business."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d75e170c-9b97-4376-a1b7-d26d2080f7f9",
                                                "sense_id": "d31f9a27-d6df-3cf6-8205-6c94a4c4f2d9",
                                                "text": "Before uni starts check your work roster with your uni schedule to make sure there are no clashes with your classes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17ce40b7-1ae4-3b2a-b0c4-773911281a39",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6f384-fc08-3f08-bb14-1b4a5a9a2453",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bracketed list that shows the elements of a set."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "roster",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b658d904-3466-3797-9ff2-65031ee21e2a",
                                        "entry_id": "eb16bfe3-67cb-3a42-a28b-5a059bd5107f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To place the name of (a person) on a roster."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eba98842-24e8-43d2-b2e3-33ff53d98408",
                                                "sense_id": "b658d904-3466-3797-9ff2-65031ee21e2a",
                                                "text": "I have rostered you for cleaning duties on the first Monday of each month."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1098d31-1122-4d0b-ac64-94d4397bc8d9",
                                                "sense_id": "b658d904-3466-3797-9ff2-65031ee21e2a",
                                                "text": "New York Central rostered literally hundreds of engine subclassifications in contrast to the Spartan simplicity of Pennsy's ranks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b069f4ef-7472-4fe0-a36d-827d09e36ad9",
                                                "sense_id": "b658d904-3466-3797-9ff2-65031ee21e2a",
                                                "text": "C. J. Boocock, \"The organisation of Eastleigh Locomotive Works\", pages 160-161:\nAfter speedy repairs, No. 35018 worked the train successfully for several days and was then rostered to the 7.20 a.m. Eastleigh-Waterloo.\n\"Motive Power Miscellany\", page 184:\nThe Guildford-Havant and Alton lines were also employed for Waterloo-Bournemouth and Weymouth traffic; some expresses diverted via the former route had to be re-rostered for light Pacifics, as the \"Merchant Navy\" class is barred from the Netley line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2bb93da-ef53-3007-98fd-d853547defab",
                                        "entry_id": "eb16bfe3-67cb-3a42-a28b-5a059bd5107f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To show the elements of a set by listing them inside brackets."
                                        ],
